<title>MALAYSIA: Sime Darby says to de-list from London.</title>
<headline>Sime Darby says to de-list from London.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's regional conglomerate Sime Darby Bhd said on Saturday that its shares will cease to be listed on the London Stock Exchange from November 16 this year.</p>
<p>In a statement to announce its results, Sime Darby said dealings on the company's shares would stop at the close of business on November 15.</p>
<p>&quot;Thereafter, the company's shares will be listed only on the main board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>No further information was given.</p>
